1
00:00:17,875 --> 00:00:20,545
宅度假胡子非常有型啊 老爸
That staycation beard's really taking shape, dad.

2
00:00:20,545 --> 00:00:21,585
开始会黏吃的了
It's starting to trap food.

3
00:00:21,595 --> 00:00:22,185
是啊
Yep.

4
00:00:22,185 --> 00:00:23,635
已经从痒变得难受了
It's gone from itchin' to bitchin'.

5
00:00:23,645 --> 00:00:25,115
你还在穿这身运动服
And you're still rocking the sweats.

6
00:00:25,115 --> 00:00:26,385
一周都没换
Every day this week.

7
00:00:26,385 --> 00:00:27,295
内裤都不换吗
Same underwear?

8
00:00:27,295 --> 00:00:28,375
什么内裤
What underwear?

9
00:00:28,895 --> 00:00:29,695
等下继续聊
Hold that thought.

10
00:00:29,695 --> 00:00:30,725
还要继续聊吗
Do I have to?

11
00:00:30,725 --> 00:00:32,575
菲城市长办公室
Mayor's office. City of Phila-Dunphy-a.

12
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,040
抱歉 我刚下班
I'm sorry. I just got done.

13
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,180
我的电脑坏了
My computer crashed,

14
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:38,040
共从台湾运来的四架板转轴
and we got four pallets of hinges from Taiwan

15
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,020
铆接又出了问题
with faulty riveting.

16
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,360
至少你的故事很吸引人[铆接]
At least your story's riveting.

17
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:41,780
好搞笑 等下给你解释
It's clever. I'll tell you later.

18
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,940
为什么小货车停在咱家停车道上
Hey, why is the minivan in the driveway?

19
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,380
你今天早上把我堵在里面了
You parked me in this morning.

20
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,260
我那时候开会快迟到了
I was running late for a meeting,

21
00:00:46,274 --> 00:00:47,594
所以我就开了海莉的花冠去的
so I just took Haley's Corolla.

22
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,040
好玩
Fun.

23
00:00:48,134 --> 00:00:49,354
要是闻起来不像
It would be if it didn't smell like

24
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,520
鲍勃·马利的洗衣篮那就真还不错
the inside of Bob Marley's laundry hamper.

25
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,460
总之我还得再打好几个电话
Anyway, I've got a bunch more calls to make.

26
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,720
今天晚上没时间做饭了
I'm not gonna have time to cook tonight.

27
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:55,700
我们可以去外面吃
We could go out.

28
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:56,980
新开了家餐馆叫滑板鞋
There's that new restaurant -- Sliders.

29
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,520
噱头就是餐馆开在一个斜坡上
The gimmick is they built it on a slant,

30
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,840
所有服务员都只穿袜子
and the waiters all wear socks.

31
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,260
听起来不怎么样啊
That doesn't sound good at all.

32
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,660
你能叫点外卖吗
Can you just order something?

33
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,720
好啊 没问题
Yeah, you got it.

34
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,340
太好了
Great.

35
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:10,560
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

36
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:11,980
走开 小狗
Run away, little dog.

37
00:01:12,694 --> 00:01:14,444
好吧 我绕开就是了
Fine. Go around you.

38
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:15,880
你不会走的
You're not gonna move.

39
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,300
因为我不会为你停车的
'Cause I'm not stopping for you.

40
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:20,970
我会为你停车的
I'm stopping for you.

41
00:01:21,704 --> 00:01:22,554
该死
Damn.

42
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:26,560
快走啊
Move it!

43
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,020
真不走吗
Seriously?

44
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,500
别忘了客人来的时候 你要照看乔哦
Don't forget you have to watch Joe while we have company.

45
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:37,120
又要吗
Again?

46
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,280
对 又要
Yes, again.

47
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,300
有什么问题吗
What is the problem?

48
00:01:39,393 --> 00:01:40,943
他老想看他的节目
He always wants to watch his show

49
00:01:40,943 --> 00:01:42,733
《神秘孩纸》 是"纸"哦
"Mystery Kidz," With a "Z."

50
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,560
太让人受不了了
It's insufferable.

51
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,600
现在你明白
Now you know what I felt

52
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,640
我陪你看你最喜欢的节目时的感受了吧
when I had to watch your favorite show.

53
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:47,900
《经典剧场》吗
"Masterpiece Theater"?

54
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,780
节目主持人是一只可怕的木偶
It was hosted by a creepy puppet.

55
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:51,120
那是艾伦·卡明
That was Alan Cumming.

56
00:01:51,743 --> 00:01:54,463
杰 你得再多搬两把椅子出来
Ay, Jay, you have to add two more chairs.

57
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,040
给谁
For who?

58
00:01:55,373 --> 00:01:56,893
我们俩 麦克克劳兹夫妇 夏普斯夫妇
It's us, the McClouds, and the Sharps.

59
00:01:56,893 --> 00:02:00,033
我还请了我朋友戴娜和她丈夫瑞斯
I also invited my friend Dana and her husband, Reece.

60
00:02:00,043 --> 00:02:01,853
瑞斯 瑞斯是谁
Reece? Who's Reece?

61
00:02:01,853 --> 00:02:03,823
我刚跟你说了啊 戴娜的老公
I just told you. Dana's husband.

62
00:02:03,823 --> 00:02:05,473
我在家长教师联谊会午餐时认识她的
I met her at the PTA lunch,

63
00:02:05,473 --> 00:02:08,103
她是反欺霸社团中唯一一个
and she's the only woman in the anti-bullying campaign

64
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,740
我不想揍的女人
that I don't want to punch in the face.

65
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,640
我为什么要请那俩人来我家里
Why would I want these people in my house

66
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:13,000
搅了我的扑克局
messing up my poker game?

67
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,560
这样你就可以认识新朋友了啊
Maybe you'll meet new friends.

68
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:17,260
我们以前就说过了啊 我不想认识什么新朋友
We've been over this before. I don't want any new friends.

69
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:19,880
我的朋友数量刚刚好
I have the exact-right number of friends.

70
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:22,040
杰 你的朋友都是
Jay, your friends have been around

71
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,960
从默片时代过来的了
since before the movies could talk.

72
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,760
我觉得开始找一些备胎
I don't think it's the worst idea

73
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,260
也不失为一个好主意
to start getting some backups.

74
00:02:41,252 --> 00:02:43,482
老爸 什么是最小公分母[特征人群]啊
Hey, Daddy, what's a lowest common denominator?

75
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:45,300
-真人秀 -好好笑
- Reality TV. - That's hilarious,

76
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,900
但我明天要考试了
but I've got a quiz tomorrow.

77
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:50,520
什么声音
What is that noise?

78
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,400
我提醒你一下 已经有好几周
Let me remind you that it's been weeks

79
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,780
楼上没人租了
since we've had a tenant up there.

80
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,840
所以你就租给一个摇滚乐队
So you rented it to a rock band?

81
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,160
一个基督教摇滚乐队
A Christian rock band.

82
00:02:57,222 --> 00:02:59,572
这下好了 所以他们又吵又爱评论人
Oh, good. Okay, so they're noisy and judge-y.

83
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:01,760
你和你这种狭隘的城市优越感太不要脸了
Shame on you and your narrow, big-city attitude.

84
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:04,300
我也认识很多有信仰的开明人士
I've known many accepting people of faith.

85
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,780
我被传教士追到了一片湖里
And I've been chased into a lake.

86
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:08,020
所以我们都有权维持自己的观点
So I guess we're both entitled to our opinion.

87
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,180
不
No!

88
00:03:11,180 --> 00:03:11,940
绝对不行
Absolutely not.

89
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,800
进
Come in.

90
00:03:16,911 --> 00:03:18,931
这是米奇尔 音乐太棒了
This is Mitchell, and the music sounds great.

91
00:03:18,931 --> 00:03:21,321
就是想问问你们有没有可能稍微小点声
Just wondering if you could turn it down a-a skosh.

92
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:23,180
当然可以 很抱歉
Yeah, of course. We're sorry.

93
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:26,040
只是想给楼上的哥们感受一下我们的新歌
Just giving the guy upstairs a taste of our new song.

94
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,400
他是说上帝
He means God.

95
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:29,120
是吗 真的没有我不知道的三楼吗
Really? There's no third floor I don't know about?

96
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,860
顺便提一嘴 我们很喜欢这里
We love the place, by the way.

97
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,660
真的非常漂亮
It's just scrumptious.

98
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:35,700
很好 很好
Good! Good!

99
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:39,180
所以你们是基督教摇滚乐队是吧
So, you guys are a Christian rock band?

100
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:41,880
化水为酒乐队 没错 就是我们
Water to Wine. Yeah, that's us.

101
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,840
我希望你们不会把
Well, I hope you're not expecting

102
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,360
你们的粉丝们都带来这里吧
to bring all your groupies back here.

103
00:03:45,681 --> 00:03:46,251
别担心
Don't worry.

104
00:03:46,251 --> 00:03:48,310
羔羊教堂的士兵
The Soldiers of the Lamb Church

105
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,650
禁止婚前关系
forbids premarital relations.

106
00:03:49,650 --> 00:03:51,660
当然 但是我也能想到几个
Of course. But I can think of a few ladies

107
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:53,400
在我们长老给过祝福后
I wouldn't mind multiplying with

108
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,100
我愿意与她生小孩的姑娘
after our elders give us their blessings.

109
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:56,160
我听到了哦
I heard that.

110
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,360
我们爱姑娘
We love girls!

111
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,980
正巧你们来了 我需要点外人的意见
As long as you guys are here, I need an outsider's opinion.

112
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:03,360
我在写一首歌
I'm working on a song,

113
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:05,600
但是这些家伙觉得这歌太温柔了
but these guys think it's too soft.

114
00:04:06,860 --> 00:04:07,920
介意听一下吗
Do you mind?

115
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,940
来吧 兄弟
Lay it on us, bro.

116
00:04:11,820 --> 00:04:14,100
*隐藏已久*
*Hiding for so long*

117
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:17,120
*不属于我的真实自我*
*The real me, I don't belong*

118
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:20,200
*我不是自己 从未曾是*
*I'm not myself, I never was*

119
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:23,640
*我在黑夜哭泣 都因为*
*I cry at night and all because*

120
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:26,440
*我困在一条秘密的小路中*
*I'm trapped on a secret path*

121
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:29,040
*我需要圣浴*
*I need a holy bath*

122
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:31,900
*洗刷我隐藏的罪孽*
*To wash away the sins I hide*

123
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:34,740
*浇熄我内心深处的小火焰*
*To douse the fire I feel inside*

124
00:04:35,539 --> 00:04:37,549
该死 戴克斯 你这样我很不爽
Aw, dang it, Dex, you're bumming me out!

125
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,960
冷静 库普
Calm down, Coop.

126
00:04:38,999 --> 00:04:40,029
我们进了城
Just 'cause we're in the city

127
00:04:40,029 --> 00:04:42,009
不代表我们就能随心所欲说话
doesn't mean we got to talk like it.

128
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:43,880
我很抱歉
I'm so sorry.

129
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,040
你知道吗 戴克斯 我喜欢这首歌
You know what, Dex, I like that song.

130
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:48,680
是啊 歌名是什么
Yeah. What's the title?

131
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,660
我叫它《求助》
I call it "A Cry for Help."

132
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:54,100
-你听到了吗 -当然 我就在这呢
- Did you hear that? -Yeah, I'm standing right here.

133
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,520
你又回来了吗
You're back again?

134
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:59,020
我也想你了
Missed you, too.

135
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:01,720
桑杰这周末回家了
Sanjay's home this weekend.

136
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,600
今天是我们一个重要的日子 一周年纪念日
It's kind of a big day for us -- our first anniversary.

137
00:05:05,209 --> 00:05:06,229
看看我给他准备了什么
Look what I got him.

138
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,360
这是一支鸭嘴龙掌骨
It's a hadrosaur metacarpal

139
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,880
他喜欢收集恐龙骨头
for his dinosaur bone collection.

140
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:11,460
太过了吗
Too much?

141
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:13,960
如果你们都是正常人这是什么等级的礼物
Well, what's the equivalent gift if you guys were normal?

142
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,800
是星巴克礼品卡还是劳力士
Like, a Starbucks card or a Rolex?

143
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:18,960
大概相当于一架很棒的显微镜吧
Kind of like a really nice microscope.

144
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:20,140
说了也白说
You're not helping.

145
00:05:20,518 --> 00:05:24,258
我还以为书呆子的周年纪念应该是呼吸器
I thought the gift for a first nerd anniversary was inhaler.

146
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:26,980
你们老爸呢
Where's your dad?

147
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,460
在楼上 怎么了
Upstairs. Why?

148
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,560
你给我们买了狗
You got us a dog?!

149
00:05:31,628 --> 00:05:33,468
不 它只是迷路了
No, no! It's a stray,

150
00:05:33,468 --> 00:05:34,548
我们不会留下它的
and we are not keeping him.

151
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:35,260
安静点
Be quiet.

152
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,020
别让你们老爸知道
Your dad cannot know he's here.

153
00:05:37,620 --> 00:05:39,020
他要是看到一定会喜欢上它
If he sees him, he'll get all attached,

154
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:40,220
我们就不可能把它送走了
and there's no getting rid of it.

155
00:05:40,298 --> 00:05:42,158
就跟卢克一样
Oh, it'll be like Luke all over again.

156
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:43,940
至少他们有我的时候已经结婚了
At least they were married when they had me.

157
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,220
你毁了妈妈的生活
You ruined mom's life.

158
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:48,400
停 我现在很高兴有你们
Stop. I am now very happy I have all of you.

159
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,420
可是我没办法再多照顾一个生物了
But I just can't take care of another living creature.

160
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,400
那你为什么还带它回家
Then why'd you bring it home?

161
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:52,860
我没法把它留在街上
I couldn't leave it in the street.

162
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:54,200
克莱尔 是你吗
Claire, is that you?

163
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:55,420
照顾好它
Take care of it.

164
00:05:55,458 --> 00:05:57,198
我不会把狗狗养死的
I'm not gonna kill a dog.

165
00:05:57,380 --> 00:05:58,440
把它藏进你房间
Hide it in your room.

166
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,580
是像我想的一样吗
Is that what I think it is?

167
00:06:00,618 --> 00:06:02,238
不是
Uh, no.

168
00:06:02,238 --> 00:06:03,937
没错 披萨到了
Yeah, pizza's here.

169
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,220
你好
How you doing?

170
00:06:07,627 --> 00:06:08,497
你们干嘛呢
What was that?

171
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:11,970
我是披萨怪
I'm the pizza monster!

172
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,460
这是我的新角色
It's this new character I'm doing.

173
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:17,520
我喜欢 我真的很喜欢
I love it. I really love it.

174
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,260
我其实不怎么喜欢
I didn't really love it.

175
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:21,440
感觉跟我的"鸡锅海盗"有点像
It felt a little close to my Chicken Pot Pirate.

176
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,740
那是个不解之谜
It's a mystery.

177
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:25,740
那是谁
Who's that?

178
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:29,020
诺尼 可以隐身
Noni. She can be invisible.

179
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:30,320
那又是谁
Who's that?

180
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,200
勾勾
Gogo.

181
00:06:31,597 --> 00:06:34,607
他能跳下高楼
He can jump off of buildings.

182
00:06:34,887 --> 00:06:37,597
这是我看过最不现实的节目
This is the most unrealistic show I've ever seen.

183
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:38,660
那又是谁
Who's that?

184
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:41,120
是 太好了 我现在开大门
Yes, great. I will open the gate.

185
00:06:41,797 --> 00:06:43,927
瑞斯 可能连修门都不会
Reece. Probably can't even work a gate.

186
00:06:43,937 --> 00:06:45,017
你可能会喜欢他
Maybe you'll like him.

187
00:06:45,017 --> 00:06:46,457
他是国王的牙医
He's the Kings' dentist.

188
00:06:46,457 --> 00:06:49,196
那我还是皇帝的橱柜制造商呢
Well, hoity-toity. I'm the emperor's closet maker.

189
00:06:49,196 --> 00:06:51,196
洛杉矶国王冰球队
The L.A. Kings hockey team.

190
00:06:51,196 --> 00:06:52,586
国王的牙医 为什么他要这么说
Kings' dentist. Why does he say it like that?

191
00:06:52,586 --> 00:06:54,006
因为这样听起来很酷炫吗
What, is he trying to be all fancy?

192
00:06:54,006 --> 00:06:56,206
他什么都没说 是我说的
He didn't say anything. I said it.

193
00:06:58,546 --> 00:06:59,466
-你好 -你好
- Hello. - Hi.

194
00:06:59,466 --> 00:07:02,486
戴娜 瑞斯 这是我先生杰
Dana, Reece, this is my husband, Jay.

195
00:07:02,516 --> 00:07:03,966
-你好 瑞斯 -你好 杰
- Hi, Reece. How are you? - Hey, Jay.

196
00:07:03,966 --> 00:07:05,386
戴娜 跟我来厨房吧
Dana, come with me to the kitchen

197
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,480
让男生们互相了解一下
while the boys get to know each other.

198
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:07,900
好
All right.

199
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,840
你听说了吗
Did you hear they're thinking

200
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,580
他们在考虑在学校里禁脏话
of eliminating cursive at the school?

201
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:13,540
所有脏话 还是艹字头那个
All of it, or just the "F" Word?

202
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:15,100
我给你带了瓶威士忌
I brought you some Scotch.

203
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,560
这瓶是好酒 谢谢
That's quite a bottle. Thank you.

204
00:07:19,246 --> 00:07:21,086
歌洛莉亚跟我说你是国王队的牙医
Gloria tells me you're the Kings' dentist.

205
00:07:21,086 --> 00:07:24,286
你提到这个的态度感觉好拽
Well, when you say it like that, it sounds so hoity-toity.

206
00:07:24,286 --> 00:07:25,546
不如把酒开了吧
Why don't we crack that open?

207
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:27,460
你这有古巴高希霸罗拔图雪茄吗
And do you have any Cohiba Robustos?

208
00:07:27,666 --> 00:07:30,306
我也想有 可是这牌子基本找不到了
Oh, I wish, but, you know, they're impossible to find.

209
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:31,860
瞧瞧看
Well, look at that.

210
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,460
我刚找到两支
I just found two.

211
00:07:35,060 --> 00:07:36,560
好吧 这人还挺不错的
Okay, the guy wasn't all bad,

212
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,200
可我不能让歌洛莉亚知道
but I couldn't let Gloria know

213
00:07:38,235 --> 00:07:40,735
不然她就会开始逼我去做一大堆
or it would open the door for a whole bunch of new things

214
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:41,580
我不想做的事
I don't want to do --

215
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:42,880
比如试新餐厅
Trendy restaurants,

216
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:45,160
关于女性一些无聊事情感觉的电影
movies about how women feel about crap.

217
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,460
谁需要那些啊
And who needs it?

218
00:07:47,855 --> 00:07:49,485
如果这周还不够惨的话
As if this week wasn't bad enough,

219
00:07:49,485 --> 00:07:52,485
我们在布鲁塞尔的硬件供应商又变卦了
now my hardware supplier in Brussels is flip-flopping.

220
00:07:52,660 --> 00:07:54,960
看来你最近吉卦不怎么多啊
Sounds like you're dealing with a real Belgian waffle.

221
00:07:56,980 --> 00:07:58,300
那是狗叫吗
Is that a dog?

222
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,380
什么 不是
What? No.

223
00:08:01,860 --> 00:08:03,400
听起来像狗叫
That sounds like a dog.

224
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,860
为了不听我说话
You will do anything

225
00:08:04,860 --> 00:08:07,240
你什么事情都做得出来 对吗
to avoid hearing me talk about work, won't you?

226
00:08:07,555 --> 00:08:11,465
我要下楼冷静一下
I'm -- I'm just gonna go cool off downstairs. Yep.

227
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:13,320
亲爱的
Honey?

228
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:14,880
她说的没错
She is right.

229
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,580
有时候我不想听她说话
Sometimes I don't listen.

230
00:08:17,705 --> 00:08:19,944
她是这么说的对吧 我不听她说话
That's what she said, right? I don't listen?

231
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:21,800
你怎么出来了
Did you get out?

232
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:23,520
快过来
Oh, come on, now.

233
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:25,260
亲爱的
Honey?

234
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:27,580
甜心
Sweetheart?

235
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:30,220
我很抱歉
I am so sorry.

236
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,740
没关系 菲尔 你回去睡吧
It's fine, Phil, really. Just go back to bed.

237
00:08:35,420 --> 00:08:38,560
我只是需要一点时间静一静
I just... need some time to myself.

238
00:08:39,404 --> 00:08:41,514
你一哭我也想哭了
Y-You know I cry when you cry.

239
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:42,700
我会上楼的
I'll be upstairs.

240
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:45,900
你没事吧
You okay?

241
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,700
只是 最近太多事了
It's just -- It's been a lot.

242
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:49,660
我爱你
I love you.

243
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:58,660
戴克斯 你好吗
Hey, Dex. How are you?

244
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,240
你没事吧
You okay?

245
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:02,900
我没事 在欣赏你们的花园而已
Yeah, I was just admiring your garden.

246
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,220
快进来吧
Hey, come on in.

247
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:07,260
其他人呢
So, uh, where is the rest of the gang?

248
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,900
参加祷告晨跑了
Oh, they're out on a prayer jog.

249
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,940
我不太喜欢
It's not really my thing.

250
00:09:12,023 --> 00:09:13,583
会经常发生吗
Is -- Is that something that happens a lot

251
00:09:13,583 --> 00:09:15,753
你觉得自己格格不入的情况
where -- where you feel different?

252
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:16,300
你好吗 德克斯
Hi, Dex.

253
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:17,340
米奇尔
Hey, Mitchell.

254
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:19,540
能不能过来帮我个忙 很快就好
Can I have you help me over here for just a second?

255
00:09:19,763 --> 00:09:20,893
好吧
Uh, okay.

256
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:24,420
你在干什么
What are you doing?

257
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,260
他明摆着想寻求帮助
He was clearly reaching out.

258
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:27,720
他在欣赏我们的花园
He was admiring our garden.

259
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:29,020
没人会欣赏我们的花园
Nobody admires our garden.

260
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:31,260
里面只有颗粘着购物袋的死仙人掌
It's a dead cactus with a grocery bag stuck to it.

261
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,360
你怎么回事
What is going on with you?

262
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,400
你不是一直不想
You're the one who never wants

263
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:34,800
掺和别人的生活吗
to get involved in people's lives.

264
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,520
你看不出来吗
Don't you see?

265
00:09:35,660 --> 00:09:37,260
他觉得被那些人困住了
He feels trapped by those guys.

266
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,740
那些借《圣经》的名义干涉别人生活的坏蛋吗
Oh, the big, bad Bible thumpers?

267
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:39,860
又来了
Here we go again.

268
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,860
我只是说可以把他的歌
I'm just saying you could read his song

269
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:42,940
《求助》
"A Cry for Help"

270
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,660
解读成是求助
as a cry for help.

271
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:47,940
米奇尔 你被传教士逼到湖里去了
Mitchell, I'm sorry you got chased into a lake,

272
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:50,340
我认识的一些最善良最有爱
but some of the kindest, most loving,

273
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:54,280
最慷慨的人都是信教的
generous people I've ever known were churchgoers.

274
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,160
我就...
Just...

275
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,000
别...
Come --

276
00:09:57,760 --> 00:10:00,700
戴克斯 我能不能发表一下个人见解
Hey, Dex, do you mind if I make a personal observation?

277
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:03,480
如果是想说我的翘臀 怪我妈咯
If it's about my hips, blame my mother.

278
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:05,160
不 不
No, no.

279
00:10:05,632 --> 00:10:07,652
是关于你昨天唱的歌
It's -- It's about the song that you sang yesterday.

280
00:10:07,652 --> 00:10:10,142
你似乎是想表达
It seemed like you were trying to express something --

281
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:11,840
你的感受
some feelings you might be having

282
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,020
而这些感受似乎
that you think might not be met with approval

283
00:10:14,020 --> 00:10:16,000
没有被你们的"小团体"认可
from your..."community."

284
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,840
或者就只是首歌
Or it's just a song.

285
00:10:18,402 --> 00:10:20,932
跟他自身情况毫无关联
Has nothing to do with his personal situation.

286
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:21,700
不 是有关联的
No, it does.

287
00:10:22,772 --> 00:10:24,162
不好意思 你的痛是真真切切的
I'm -- I'm sorry. Your pain is real.

288
00:10:24,162 --> 00:10:26,052
我只是觉得好有负罪感
I just feel so guilty.

289
00:10:26,052 --> 00:10:27,632
我知道大家会很失望
I know people will be disappointed.

290
00:10:27,780 --> 00:10:29,080
别 别 不要有负罪感
No, no, don't feel guilty.

291
00:10:29,220 --> 00:10:32,040
听着 第一步就是要大声说出来
Look, the first step is to say it out loud.

292
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,340
我不想当鼓手
I don't want to be a drummer.

293
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:38,200
好 继续说
Okay, now say the other thing.

294
00:10:38,980 --> 00:10:41,160
我不想再呆在乐队里了
I don't want to be in a band anymore.

295
00:10:41,340 --> 00:10:42,640
我好想家
I miss home.

296
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,280
好想我的女友
I miss my girlfriend.

297
00:10:44,551 --> 00:10:46,141
-抱歉 什么 -抱歉 你的什么
- I'm sorry. Whoa. What? - I'm sorry. Your what?

298
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,560
感觉心里一下释然了
It's like a weight has been lifted.

299
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,660
太感谢你们了
Thank you so much, guys.

300
00:10:52,641 --> 00:10:54,961
我今天本想呆在里面的
You know, I was just gonna stay inside today,

301
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:58,180
还好出来了
but I'm really glad I came out.

302
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,100
他才不是想说那些
He doesn't get to say that.

303
00:11:02,551 --> 00:11:03,451
乔
Oh, hey, Joe.

304
00:11:03,451 --> 00:11:05,171
现在在播新一集《神秘孩纸》
Uh, there's a new "Mystery Kidz" on.

305
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:05,880
我不看了 谢谢
No, thanks.

306
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:06,700
"我不看了 谢谢"
"No, thanks"?

307
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,040
你难道不好奇谁偷了普可的魔法翅膀吗
Aren't you curious who stole Poco's magic wings?

308
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,140
没什么兴趣
Not really.

309
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,480
可是每个人都有嫌疑
But everyone's a suspect.

310
00:11:11,660 --> 00:11:13,080
钟表匠讨厌普可
The watchmaker hates Poco,

311
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:15,080
布丁市长会不惜一切手段留任
and Mayor Pudding would do anything to stay in office.

312
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:16,660
你怎么会不想看接下来发生了什么呢
How could you not want to see what happens?

313
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,360
喂
Hello?

314
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:23,320
对 等等
Uh, yes. Hold on.

315
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:25,140
杰 是瑞斯
Jay, it's Reece.

316
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,860
你看 歌洛莉亚
You see, Gloria?

317
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,000
现在他开始给我打电话了
Now he's calling me.

318
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:29,700
我怕的就是这个
This is what I was afraid of.

319
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:30,680
他打电话来了
He called.

320
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:32,120
我的新朋友打电话了
My new friend called.

321
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:34,000
要带我去看冰球比赛
He's taking me to a hockey game.

322
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,760
太棒了
Great.

323
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:38,530
现在我非得跟瑞斯去一个什么无聊的慈善活动
Now I'm stuck going to some boring charity event with Reece.

324
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,880
你看你妈给我惹的好事
You see what your mom got me into?

325
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,740
杰 别这样 开明点
Jay, come on. Keep an open mind.

326
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:44,750
我们只是觉得要给瑞斯一个机会
All we're saying is give Reece a chance.

327
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:48,100
雷克斯
Rex.

328
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:49,260
史都比
Scooby.

329
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:50,500
克利福德
Clifford.

330
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:51,540
你在干吗
What are you doing?

331
00:11:51,700 --> 00:11:52,840
猜它的名字
Trying to figure out his name.

332
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:53,720
你考虑过老爸吗
What about Dad?

333
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:54,440
给 老爸
Here, Dad.

334
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:55,720
不是
Nope.

335
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:57,360
不用猜他的名字
You do not need to figure out his name

336
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,190
因为我们要去贴启示
because we're going to put these fliers up,

337
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,410
就会有人打电话来了
and someone's gonna call.

338
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,900
我给桑杰的恐龙化石呢
What happened to the dinosaur bone I got for Sanjay?

339
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,740
我看到史努比
I saw Snoop...

340
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:07,640
在后院埋东西
burying something in the backyard.

341
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,140
你什么都没做吗
And you didn't do anything?

342
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:10,400
我帮它开了门
I opened the door for him.

343
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:12,580
那块化石有6500万年的历史
That bone lasted 65 million years,

344
00:12:12,580 --> 00:12:14,320
在这个家居然撑不过一天
and it can't even last one day in this house?!

345
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,180
-克莱尔 -我的天 你爸来了
- Claire. - Oh, my God, your father!

346
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:18,060
狗 带出去 出去
The dog -- outside! Outside! Outside!

347
00:12:18,820 --> 00:12:19,460
怎么了 亲爱的
Yeah, honey?

348
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:21,300
甜心 昨晚的事
Sweetheart, about last night.

349
00:12:21,489 --> 00:12:23,779
我没用这俩耳朵认真听你说话
Because I didn't listen with these two ears...

350
00:12:23,779 --> 00:12:24,289
对
Yes.

351
00:12:24,289 --> 00:12:28,109
我想用这些郁金香[俩嘴唇]道歉
I want to apologize with these tu-lips.

352
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:30,540
太... 你太好了
Oh, that is very -- That's so sweet of you.

353
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:31,500
谢谢你 宝贝
Thank you, baby.

354
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:35,880
太好了 那是玉米片渣吗
Great. Oh, is that a tortilla chip right there?

355
00:12:35,979 --> 00:12:36,809
就那
Yeah --

356
00:12:36,909 --> 00:12:38,309
你好吗 昨天的朋友
Hola, amigo from yesterday.

357
00:12:38,309 --> 00:12:39,679
你不会要吃吧
You're not gonna eat that, are you?

358
00:12:39,679 --> 00:12:41,079
才不 多恶心
No, that would be disgusting.

359
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:41,740
这是啥
What are these?

360
00:12:42,109 --> 00:12:43,559
那个是 是
Oh, that's a -- It's a...

361
00:12:44,269 --> 00:12:45,239
蛋白质零食
It's a protein snack.

362
00:12:45,239 --> 00:12:46,199
不喜欢的话就别吃了
You don't have to eat that if you don't like it.

363
00:12:46,199 --> 00:12:46,999
不会
No.

364
00:12:47,249 --> 00:12:48,069
我喜欢 好吃
I like it. Good.

365
00:12:48,069 --> 00:12:50,009
有肝味[活力]
It's -- It's liver-y.

366
00:12:51,340 --> 00:12:53,020
你太会照顾我们了
You take such good care of us.

367
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:53,860
谢谢 亲爱的
Thanks, honey.

368
00:12:54,098 --> 00:12:55,368
我们应该把花放到花瓶里
We should get those flowers in a a vase.

369
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,080
不 菲尔
No, Phil.

370
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:57,340
别用那个花瓶
Not that vase.

371
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:58,520
看着我
Look at me!

372
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,720
好好看着我
Really look at me.

373
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,300
我觉得我在看啊
I feel like I am.

374
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:05,720
你还是不明白 对吧
You're just not getting it, are you?

375
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:08,440
对不起 我想一个人待会
I'm sorry. I need some alone time.

376
00:13:14,660 --> 00:13:16,760
抱歉一直敲你家门
Sorry for knocking on your door so persistently,

377
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,580
可我们找不到戴克斯了
but we can't find Dex,

378
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:20,300
他的行李也不见了
and all his matching luggage is gone.

379
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,740
你们知道他去哪了吗
Do you have any idea where he is?

380
00:13:22,648 --> 00:13:23,528
我... 我不知道 米奇尔
I don-- I don't know, Mitchell.

381
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:25,540
最后跟他说话的是你吧
Weren't you the last person to talk to him?

382
00:13:25,588 --> 00:13:26,828
我们的时间不多了
And we haven't got much time.

383
00:13:26,828 --> 00:13:27,648
要是我们没有鼓手
If we don't have a drummer,

384
00:13:27,648 --> 00:13:28,938
就得被迫取消演出
we're gonna have to cancel the gig.

385
00:13:28,948 --> 00:13:31,528
我主行事 凡人莫测
Well, the Lord works in mysterious ways.

386
00:13:31,528 --> 00:13:33,118
-打住... -我...
- Don't even... - I...

387
00:13:33,828 --> 00:13:34,908
真是毁灭性打击
Aah, this is devastating.

388
00:13:35,100 --> 00:13:36,360
如果我们不演出 就拿不到报酬
If we don't play, we won't get paid,

389
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:37,720
也就没有足够的钱回家了
and we don't have enough money to get home.

390
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,800
你们不明白戴克斯正在经历什么
Hey, you don't know what Dex is going through.

391
00:13:39,987 --> 00:13:42,357
人务须遵从本性
One hath to be true to the way one was born.

392
00:13:42,357 --> 00:13:44,197
得了 你不能随便加个"务须"
Okay, you can't just add "Hath"

393
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,480
就假装是《圣经》里的话
and pretend it was in the Bible.

394
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:48,180
我想我们得打电话给音乐厅取消演出了
Well, I guess we better call the venue and cancel the gig.

395
00:13:48,380 --> 00:13:50,340
天啊 好了 你懂的
Oh, boy, well, you know.

396
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,800
我可以做你们的鼓手
I could be your drummer.

397
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,080
上帝啊 又来了
Oh, God, here we go.

398
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,020
真的吗 你会打鼓
Really? You play?

399
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,340
我对上面那位发誓
Swear to G-dash-D.

400
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:59,280
来几段音乐试试 我能跟上节奏
Just play me a few bars. I can pick it up, follow along.

401
00:14:00,220 --> 00:14:02,200
卡梅伦先生 太感谢你了
Mr. Cameron, thank you so much.

402
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:05,300
你让我想起某个重要的人
You kind of remind me of another special someone

403
00:14:05,300 --> 00:14:07,980
他曾为我们做出重大牺牲
who made a pretty big sacrifice to save us.

404
00:14:08,087 --> 00:14:09,367
拜托 别把我比作你的...
Please, do not compare me to your...

405
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,140
是伯尼·考夫曼先生 我们的经纪人
Mr. Bernie Kaufman, our manager.

406
00:14:11,300 --> 00:14:13,400
他烧了他的鞋店[骗保险]赞助我们首张唱片小样
He burnt down his shoe store to pay for our first demo.

407
00:14:17,467 --> 00:14:17,807
你在干嘛呢
what are you doing?

408
00:14:17,807 --> 00:14:18,687
天啊 你快把狗抱走
Oh, God, you take the dog,

409
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:19,780
我把这收拾干净 好吗
and I'll clean this up, okay?

410
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:20,160
好
Okay.

411
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:23,040
亲爱的 我找了几个备选花瓶
Honey, I got some vase options.

412
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:26,380
怎么回事
What happened?

413
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:29,440
你觉得是怎么回事
what do you think happened?

414
00:14:29,700 --> 00:14:31,720
我觉得她认为送花道歉
I think she saw those flowers as the shallow

415
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:32,980
是种肤浅的行为
transparent gesture they were

416
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:35,580
她有理由一气之下把它们撕烂
and shredded them to pieces in a justifiable rage.

417
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:37,120
没错
Yep.

418
00:14:37,776 --> 00:14:39,586
我做了什么事让她这么生气
What have I done to upset her so much?

419
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:41,180
也许你照照镜子
Maybe you should look in a mirror

420
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:42,780
就能回答自己的问题了
and ask yourself that question.

421
00:14:46,016 --> 00:14:48,696
我的老天啊 瞧我变成什么人了
Sweet Teen Wolf, what have I become?

422
00:14:50,300 --> 00:14:51,360
看见那家伙了吗
You see that guy?

423
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:53,680
我在他的牙上下了不少功夫
I have done so much work on his mouth

424
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,760
花费足够付我船上的热水浴缸
that he's paid for the hot tub on my boat.

425
00:14:58,436 --> 00:15:00,276
科皮塔刚才是跟你招手吗
Did Kopitar just wave to you?

426
00:15:00,286 --> 00:15:01,316
那可不
It's the least he can do.

427
00:15:01,316 --> 00:15:04,306
这周末我要带他去卡特琳娜钓鱼
I'm taking him out fishing this weekend in Catalina.

428
00:15:04,406 --> 00:15:05,946
你想来吗
Hey, hey, do you want to come?

429
00:15:05,946 --> 00:15:07,616
天啊 我当然很愿意去
Oh, my God, I'd love to go.

430
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:09,500
-不过... -怎么了
- Oh, but... - What?

431
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:11,600
昨晚你来之前
Last night, before you got there,

432
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,460
歌洛莉亚和我大吵了一架
Gloria and I got in a big to-do

433
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:15,220
因为我不想认识新朋友
about me not needing new friends.

434
00:15:16,475 --> 00:15:18,525
现在你不愿意承认自己错了
And now you don't want to admit you were wrong.

435
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,820
你真懂我
Wow, do you get me.

436
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:24,560
这会儿应该是观赏鲸鱼的好天气
Well, it's supposed to be perfect whale-watching weather,

437
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,820
还有 对了
and, uh, oh, yeah,

438
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:27,200
格雷斯基也会来
Gretzky's coming, too.

439
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,080
有名的那个吗
The Great One?

440
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,000
他不跟人分享望远镜 这点倒臭名昭著
Not at sharing the binoculars, he isn't.

441
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:31,680
真要命 我去不了
It's killing me I can't go!

442
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:33,380
我有个疯狂的主意
Well, here's a crazy idea.

443
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:36,280
你干嘛不对你妻子实话实话
Why don't you tell your wife the truth

444
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:37,780
承认你错了
and admit you were wrong?

445
00:15:38,340 --> 00:15:40,160
你没我想的那么懂我
You don't get me like I thought you did.

446
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:41,340
要不然呢
Or...?

447
00:15:41,340 --> 00:15:42,540
好吧 我会跟她说实话的
Fine. I'll level with her.

448
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:49,020
你是怎么回事啊
What is going on?

449
00:15:51,795 --> 00:15:52,965
太好了 不是老爸
Ohh, good, you're not Dad.

450
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:54,880
你和桑杰进展得怎么样
So, how'd it go with Sanjay?

451
00:15:54,904 --> 00:15:56,594
他记得你们的纪念日吗
Did he remember your anniversary?

452
00:15:56,654 --> 00:15:57,714
你说呢
You tell me.

453
00:15:57,784 --> 00:15:59,104
我把化石送给他之后
After I gave him the fossil,

454
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:02,100
他给了我这只箱子作为斯坦福浪漫周末的礼物
he gave me this for romantic weekends up at Stanford.

455
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:04,260
看起来像是二手货
It looks kind of used.

456
00:16:04,924 --> 00:16:06,334
你觉得有没有可能他忘了
Do you think it's possible he forgot

457
00:16:06,334 --> 00:16:07,274
只是随手拿了一件东西...
and just grabbed the first thing that he's...

458
00:16:07,420 --> 00:16:08,160
闭嘴 他爱我的
Shut up! He loves me!

459
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:10,660
真不敢相信连一个电话都没有
I can't believe i haven't gotten a single call.

460
00:16:10,854 --> 00:16:13,034
我已经贴出无数启示了
I must have put up a thousand fliers.

461
00:16:16,220 --> 00:16:17,180
大伙好啊
Hey, guys.

462
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:19,080
亲爱的
Honey.

463
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,340
-克莱尔 -在
-Claire. -Yeah.

464
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:23,380
我想跟你谈谈
I want to talk to you.

465
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:25,600
我真的很抱歉
I am so sorry.

466
00:16:26,260 --> 00:16:27,320
我不听你说话
I don't listen.

467
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:29,780
光想靠送花解决问题
I try to solve problems with flowers.

468
00:16:30,034 --> 00:16:32,454
还在朋友面前捏造你的负面形象
I do unflattering impressions of you for my friends.

469
00:16:32,454 --> 00:16:35,044
最糟糕的是 我放任自己
And worst of all, I let myself go.

470
00:16:35,314 --> 00:16:37,984
所以我刮了胡子 换了衣服
So I shaved and put on a suit.

471
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,100
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

472
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:40,200
那是什么
What's that?

473
00:16:40,723 --> 00:16:41,583
什么
What?

474
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,540
天啊 你收拾了行李
Oh, my God. You packed a suitcase.

475
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:45,920
你要离开一段时间
You need some time away.

476
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,420
我想我做这一切都...
I guess all this was...

477
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:48,360
太不够了 也太迟了
too little, too late.

478
00:16:48,413 --> 00:16:50,393
但不包括美黑 做得时间太长 也太黑
Well, not the spray tan. That was too much, too long.

479
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:51,700
我觉得那个喷嘴坏了
I think the nozzle was broken.

480
00:16:52,180 --> 00:16:55,380
你全都理解错了 都是我不好
You're getting this all wrong, and it's all my fault.

481
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:56,500
好吧 听着
Okay, look,

482
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:58,400
我一直拼命躲着你 没错
I have been trying to distract you, yes,

483
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:01,380
可那是因为我一直在想着对我有好处的事
but because I have been thinking about what was good for me

484
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:04,020
而不是可能会对你有好处的事
and not what might be good for you.

485
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:05,820
我不知道
So I have no idea

486
00:17:05,820 --> 00:17:08,420
我们能不能找到它真正的主人
if we're ever gonna find out who his real owner is,

487
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,840
如果找不到的话 你可以养着它
but if we don't, you can keep him.

488
00:17:11,940 --> 00:17:13,620
我为什么要养唐克斯里家的狗
Why would I want the Tanksley's dog?

489
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:14,560
你说什么
What?

490
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:15,540
这是巴迪
This is Buddy.

491
00:17:15,593 --> 00:17:17,073
你不知道唐克斯一家搬去克里夫顿了吗
You know the Tanksley's over on Clifton?

492
00:17:17,073 --> 00:17:18,123
我卖掉了他们的房子
I sold them their house.

493
00:17:18,123 --> 00:17:19,183
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

494
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:21,620
不过如果你同意我养宠物的话
But if you're open to me getting a pet...

495
00:17:21,620 --> 00:17:23,440
当然同意 养只狗吧
Yeah. Of course. Get a dog.

496
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,240
不 我不想养狗
No, I don't want a dog.

497
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,740
我想养只凤头鹦鹉带去滑旱冰
I want a cockatoo to take Rollerblading.

498
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,440
想象一下 有只凤头鹦鹉站在我肩膀上
How cool would that be sitting on my shoulder

499
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:28,840
我的衬衫迎风飘动 那得多酷啊
my half shirt flapping in the wind?

500
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,060
你不能养鸟
You're not getting a bird.

501
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:31,460
-你是认真的吗 -是
- Are you serious? - Yeah.

502
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:33,260
那些养鸟的人
People that have birds

503
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:34,420
让鸟站在他们肩膀上到处走
and walk around with them on their shoulders --

504
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:35,200
他们看起来太可笑了
They look ridiculous.

505
00:17:35,340 --> 00:17:37,200
那完全是为了吸引别人的注意而用力过度
It's obviously a desperate cry for attention.

506
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:37,800
好吧
Okay.

507
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:41,000
现在轮到我需要时间静静了
Now I need some time to myself.

508
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,180
你在看什么
What are you doing?

509
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:47,680
没什么
Nothing.

510
00:17:47,772 --> 00:17:49,692
你在看《神秘孩纸》
You're watching "Mystery Kidz."

511
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:50,980
你不是说不想看吗
You said you didn't want to.

512
00:17:51,172 --> 00:17:54,872
是不想跟你一起看 你问题太多了
Not with you. You ask too many questions.

513
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:55,840
你这么说很过分
That's rude.

514
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:57,700
我可是出于礼貌才看的
I was only watching as a courtesy.

515
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,100
刚发生什么了
What just happened?

516
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:00,820
等等 那是谁
Wait, who's that?

517
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:01,580
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

518
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:03,920
慈善会怎么样
How was the charity event?

519
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:05,380
我有话跟你说
I have to talk to you about something.

520
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:06,780
怎么了
What?

521
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:08,840
我要跟你说声对不起
I owe you an apology.

522
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,140
我这周末要去克利夫兰
I have to go to Cleveland this weekend

523
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:13,300
参加一个姑妈的葬礼
for my Aunt Bea's funeral.

524
00:18:13,540 --> 00:18:14,240
很慈祥的一个老太太
Nice old lady.

525
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,120
她从悬崖上摔下去了
Fell off a cliff.

526
00:18:15,321 --> 00:18:17,701
我和你一起去 我马上去收拾行李
I'll -- I'll go with you. I'll start packing right now.

527
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,540
不 你跟乔和曼尼留在这儿
No, no, no. You stay here with Joe and Manny.

528
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:20,960
我会寄个雪花玻璃球给你
I'll send you a snow globe.

529
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:22,720
我们有多余的望远镜吗
Hey, did we have an extra pair of binoculars?

530
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:24,040
我看到外面有只奇怪的鸟
I saw a weird bird outside.

531
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,380
别再撒谎了
Stop with the lies.

532
00:18:25,821 --> 00:18:27,601
我真搞不懂男人
I really don't understand men.

533
00:18:27,751 --> 00:18:30,641
你就不能直接承认你错了吗
Why can't you just admit that you were wrong?

534
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:32,120
这又不是缺点
It's not a weakness.

535
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:32,740
这是个优点
It's a strength,

536
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:35,300
我会因此更爱你 更尊重你
and I would love you and respect you more.

537
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:36,260
好吧
Fine.

538
00:18:37,001 --> 00:18:39,481
我喜欢瑞斯 我想和他出去玩[私奔]
I like Reece, and I want to go away with him.

539
00:18:39,481 --> 00:18:40,611
我就知道
I knew it!

540
00:18:40,611 --> 00:18:42,611
我是对的 你是错的
I was right, and you were wrong!

541
00:18:43,061 --> 00:18:46,251
从现在开始 我们要不断尝试新事物
From now on, we're gonna do new things all the time.

542
00:18:46,261 --> 00:18:48,471
明天我们去埃塞俄比亚餐厅吃饭
Tomorrow we're going to an Ethiopian restaurant,

543
00:18:48,471 --> 00:18:49,721
然后去看部电影
and then we're gonna watch a movie

544
00:18:49,721 --> 00:18:52,461
那电影讲述了一封迟到30年的情书
about a love letter that arrived 30 years late

545
00:18:52,461 --> 00:18:54,431
改变了两个女人一生的故事
and changed the life of two women.

546
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:57,000
我能带上瑞斯吗
Can I bring Reece?

547
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:57,500
不行
No!

548
00:19:00,390 --> 00:19:02,400
大家好 我们来一起做表演前祷告吧
Hey, everyone, let's gather for the preshow prayer.

549
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:04,690
就像麦当娜和她的伴舞们一样
Kind of like Madonna and her backup dancers.

550
00:19:04,900 --> 00:19:06,280
米奇尔先生 你想和我们一起吗
Mr. Mitchell, would you like to join us?

551
00:19:06,310 --> 00:19:07,760
不用了 谢谢
Oh, I'm good. Thank you.

552
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:08,590
好的
All right.

553
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:10,640
仁慈的上帝
Heavenly Father,

554
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:15,340
请保佑我们的粉丝万分喜爱今晚的演出
we ask that you make this show super-amazing for all of our fans,

555
